+
+V43.6 Executive KPI Studio adds configurable executive targets and scorecard persistence.
+
+V43.7 Executive Timeline combines canonical live events, executive insights, recommendations, and priority risk into one chronological operating narrative.
+
+V43.8 Executive Portfolio Health ranks restaurant locations using live coverage, portfolio telemetry, and executive risk.
+
+Build: `43.8.0-executive-performance-control`
