+# Apply V43.8.0
+
+Copy the files in this patch over the current V43.5 repository, preserving paths.
+
+Restart:
+
+```powershell
+taskkill /F /IM node.exe
+npm run start
+```
+
+Open `http://localhost:8787/?pack=executive`.
+
+Recommended validation order: Executive KPI Studio → Executive Timeline → Executive Portfolio Health.
